      Languages:
      - A full-face, properly fitted helmet is the only protection for the head.
      - "Un casco \xEDntegro y ajustado es la \xFAnica protecci\xF3n de la cabeza."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: M1/Item_ClothingLoose_Risk
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Loose clothing and shoelaces reach the chain and spokes.
      - La ropa y los cordones sueltos llegan a la cadena y a los rayos.
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: M1/Item_ElbowPads_Risk
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
